			"Message": "docs(Rest): overhaul CHANGELOG with Keep-a-Changelog format\n\nComplete rewrite of the CHANGELOG to align with Keep-a-Changelog conventions and provide richer narrative around Rest's evolution. Rest is the JS bundler that compiles VS Code platform source into bundled trees loaded by Cocoon and Sky.\n\nReorganized content across all versions (v2.1 back to v0.0), added commit SHAs with dates for key milestones, expanded the OXC migration documentation (the pivotal v2.0 change from March 2026), and added a new \"Fixed\" section documenting the January 2026 stability sweep. The CHANGELOG now clearly tells Rest's story from SWC origins through the OXC pivot to the current full-workbench state.\n\nVersion headings simplified from \"Q2 2026: Full Workbench Lift\" to \"Full Workbench Lift (April 2026)\" for clarity.",
